type: software
title: "MetaSprint DTA: Automated Open-Access Evidence Discovery for Diagnostic Test Accuracy Meta-Analysis"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-03-18
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/mahmood726-cyber/metasprint-dta
abstract: >-
  Browser-based platform integrating a four-source Open-Access Discovery Pipeline
  with bivariate GLMM/HSROC statistical engine for diagnostic test accuracy
  meta-analysis. Validated against 70 published meta-analyses across 13 clinical
  specialties with R cross-validation (33/33 parity).
keywords:
  - diagnostic test accuracy
  - meta-analysis
  - bivariate model
  - HSROC
  - open access
  - evidence synthesis
  - browser application
  - automated extraction
